        },
        "quote": "(b) The Department of Administrative and Financial Services shall maintain records of all fixed assets owned by the City. The records shall include pertinent information as deemed appropriate. The Department of Administrative and Financial Services shall verify or request verification from all departments or organizations of all assets or asset records.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.30.260:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
